Package: audiolite-devicetree
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Audiolite device tree overlay
 Qualcomm Audiolite device tree overlay package for SA8775P, SA8255P and
 SA8797P platforms. Provides compiled device tree binary overlay (.dtbo)
 files for the Audiolite audio framework.
 .
 Includes common overlays for all platforms and optional Audiolite-specific
 overlays when ENABLE_AUDIOLITE_OVERLAY is set.

Package: audiolite-devicetree-dev
Section: devel
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 audiolite-devicetree (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Audiolite device tree overlay - development headers
 Development header files for the Audiolite device tree overlay.
 Includes DT binding headers for qcom-audiolite-ipcc and related
 interfaces.
